msgid "Don’t have a card? Pay with Mobile Money"
msgstr "没有银行卡？使用 Mobile Money 付款"

#: templates/dashboard/home.html:67
msgid "Automatic renewal"
msgstr "自动续订"

#: templates/emails/auto_renewal_cancelled.txt:3
#, python-format
msgid "Automatic renewal is now off. Your plan stays active until %(date)s, and we no longer keep your card for renewal. We will send you reminders before your plan ends."
msgstr "自动续订现已关闭。您的套餐在 %(date)s 前仍然有效，我们也不再保存您的银行卡用于续订。套餐到期前，我们会向您发送提醒。"

#: templates/emails/auto_renewal_cancelled.txt:5
#, python-format
msgid "To turn it back on, pay by card here: %(link)s"
msgstr "如需重新开启，请在此使用银行卡付款：%(link)s"

#: templates/emails/auto_renewal_failed.txt:3
#, python-format
msgid "We could not charge your card (%(card)s) to renew your plan, so automatic renewal has stopped. Your card stays live until %(until)s."
msgstr "我们无法从您的银行卡（%(card)s）扣款来续订套餐，因此自动续订已停止。您的名片在 %(until)s 前仍可使用。"

#: templates/emails/auto_renewal_failed.txt:5
#, python-format
msgid "To keep it live, renew here: %(link)s"
msgstr "如需保持名片上线，请在此续订：%(link)s"

#: templates/emails/auto_renewal_failed.txt:5
#, python-format
msgid "We could not charge your card (%(card)s) to renew your plan. We will try again on %(date)s."
msgstr "我们无法从您的银行卡（%(card)s）扣款来续订套餐，将于 %(date)s 再次尝试。"

#: templates/emails/auto_renewal_failed.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid "To pay with a different card or with Mobile Money now, go to: %(link)s"
msgstr "如需现在使用其他银行卡或 Mobile Money 付款，请前往：%(link)s"

#: templates/emails/auto_renewal_notice.txt:3
#, python-format
msgid "Your %(plan)s renews on %(date)s. We will charge %(amount)s to your card (%(card)s) on that day. You do not need to do anything."
msgstr "您的套餐（%(plan)s）将于 %(date)s 续订。届时我们将从您的银行卡（%(card)s）扣款 %(amount)s，您无需任何操作。"

#: templates/emails/auto_renewal_notice.txt:5
#, python-format
msgid "The yearly price has changed since your last payment, from %(previous)s to %(amount)s."
msgstr "自您上次付款以来，年费已由 %(previous)s 调整为 %(amount)s。"

#: templates/emails/auto_renewal_notice.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid "To turn off automatic renewal, or to pay with a different card, go to: %(link)s"
msgstr "如需关闭自动续订或更换银行卡，请前往：%(link)s"

#: templates/emails/payment_receipt.txt:14
#, python-format
msgid "This was your automatic yearly renewal. To turn off automatic renewal, go to: %(link)s"
msgstr "这是您的年度自动续订。如需关闭自动续订，请前往：%(link)s"

#: templates/emails/payment_receipt.txt:16
#, python-format
msgid "Your plan will renew automatically on %(date)s: we will charge your card (%(card)s) and email you a week before. To turn off automatic renewal, go to: %(link)s"
msgstr "您的套餐将于 %(date)s 自动续订：我们会从您的银行卡（%(card)s）扣款，并提前一周发邮件提醒。如需关闭自动续订，请前往：%(link)s"

#: templates/marketing/legal_refunds.html:7
msgid "Plan payments, including automatic yearly renewals, are not refundable once your card is active, except for duplicate charges or a proven failure of the service."
msgstr "套餐付款（包括每年的自动续订）在名片生效后不予退款，重复扣款或服务确实出现故障的情况除外。"

#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:14
msgid "A plan paid by Mobile Money is renewed by you. A plan paid by card renews automatically each year: on the day it ends we charge the same card the plan price shown at checkout, we email you about 7 days before and send a receipt after, and you can turn automatic renewal off at any time in your dashboard. Turning it off keeps your plan until the end of the year already paid for. Renewing early adds a year to your current end date."
msgstr "通过 Mobile Money 付款的套餐需由您自行续订。通过银行卡付款的套餐每年自动续订：套餐到期当天，我们会按结账时显示的套餐价格从同一张银行卡扣款，并在约 7 天前发邮件提醒、扣款后发送收据，您可以随时在控制面板中关闭自动续订。关闭后，套餐会持续到已付费年度结束。提前续订会在当前到期日基础上增加一年。"
